  [38;5;246mThe stack's standard (eslint+prettier, or ruff+ruff format). Catches drift from the first commit.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Unit test infrastructure
  [38;5;246mRunner, layout, and a first passing fixture. Needed for TDD on the routing/subscription logic, which is where the real
[39m  [38;5;246mbugs will be.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end test infrastructure
  [38;5;246mDrives a real browser against a running server. Proves the bell actually updates; heavier to set up and maintain.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Fuzz or mutation testing
